            <ArticleTitle>Omura's &quot;Bi-Digital O-Ring Test&quot; as a guide to acupuncture treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>217-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Omura's &quot;Bi-Digital O-Ring Test&quot; is a valuable aid in the search for the site of pathology. We may use it also to confirm the acupuncture points to be used for treatment. This test provides excellent opportunity to test the immediate and long term results of our treatment, too.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
